            "review_title": "Review at Chi Em Quan",
            "review_text": "Duong Pham\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nGreat authentic Viet food\nDec 2019 • Family\nIf you want really good authentic Vietnamese cuisine within City centre (District 3) then this is the place for you! Look no more. We dine here for several times and really like their crunchy fish w/ mango dipping with special fish sauce. Also try out their rice in earth pot with braised fish. Truly tasty! \nWe always leave the place with full belly and happy faces!\nHighly recommend this place!\nRead more\nWritten December 22, 2019",
